I set up cron job c10. It runs every 20 minutes until 15:49 today.

Each run it:
- picks up finished agents and resumes any that errored;
- keeps up to four agents working;
- drives each ticket in review in the app, then commits it or sends it back;
- moves shipped tickets to done and drops obsolete ones;
- deletes old agent build folders to keep disk free.

It never runs anything that waits for your approval. The last run writes a morning summary.

